# Bluetooth (app/bt.c): Setup's two rows; GLO's SEL list, two pairs: BT MIDI (on or off) and MIDI DEVICE, BT AUDIO
# (on or off) and AUDIO DEVICE (SEL: their lists, each with a first line that says what to do). The audio list with
# the simulator's stand-in ("Speaker": found half a second into a scan, playing 0.3 s after a connect), FORGET asked
# first; the MIDI devices' list with fm1-base's stand-in ("BLE MIDI"); a computer's link refusing devices; BT MIDI
# off (no advertising, MIDI DEVICE refused) and audio on, both kept over a restart; a pairing's code in the header
wait 1500
tap GLO
turn SELECT -2
wait 100
expect page Setup
shot bt_setup.png
listen
# SEL on Setup: GLO's list, on BT MIDI; AUDIO DEVICE three below says what SEL does
tap SEL
wait 300
said BT MIDI on
turn SELECT 3
wait 300
said AUDIO DEVICE choose, action
shot bt_glo_list.png
# SEL: the audio devices, looked for while the list is up
tap SEL
wait 300
said Audio devices list. looking for devices...
wait 600
said still looking. SEL connects. Speaker new
shot bt_audio_list.png
# SEL: connect it (audio turns on, kept in the project)
tap SEL
wait 600
said BT AUDIO Speaker
expect dirty 1
wait 100
shot bt_setup_playing.png
# the list again: Speaker remembered and playing, no scan while it plays
tap SEL
turn SELECT 3
tap SEL
wait 300
said pick a device. SEL connects. Speaker playing
turn SELECT 9
wait 100
said FORGET Speaker
shot bt_audio_forget.png
# FORGET asks; HOME says no
tap SEL
wait 100
expect ask 1
tap HOME
wait 100
expect ask 0
tap HOME
# BT AUDIO: ALGORITHM off, SEL on again (the last device)
tap SEL
turn SELECT 2
turn ALGO -1
wait 200
said BT AUDIO off
tap SEL
wait 600
said BT AUDIO Speaker
tap HOME
# BT MIDI off: no advertising, MIDI DEVICE says so and SEL there does nothing
tap SEL
turn ALGO -1
wait 200
said BT MIDI off
expect ble 0
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
said MIDI DEVICE BT MIDI off
tap SEL
wait 100
said BT MIDI OFF turn it on first
tap HOME
wait 100
shot bt_setup_midi_off.png
# saved, then a restart: BT MIDI stays off, audio was on so Speaker connects again once the radio is up
tap SAVE
wait 100
reboot
wait 2000
expect ble 0
tap GLO
turn SELECT -2
wait 100
shot bt_after_reboot.png
listen
where
said BT audio Speaker, BT MIDI off
# BT MIDI on again (SEL toggles it too)
tap SEL
tap SEL
wait 1200
said BT MIDI on
expect ble 2
# the MIDI devices: MIDI DEVICE's list looks while it is up
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
said MIDI DEVICE choose
tap SEL
wait 200
said MIDI devices list. looking for MIDI devices...
wait 700
said pick a device. SEL connects. BLE MIDI found
shot bt_dev_list.png
tap SEL
wait 600
said CONNECTED BLE MIDI
expect ble_dev 4
wait 100
shot bt_setup_device.png
tap SEL
turn SELECT 1
tap SEL
wait 200
said connected. SEL lets it go. DISCONNECT BLE MIDI
tap SEL
wait 200
said DISCONNECTED
expect ble_dev 0
# a computer connected: no devices, said plainly
ble connect
wait 100
tap SEL
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
said MIDI DEVICE computer connected
tap SEL
wait 200
said NO DEVICE computer connected
ble disconnect
# a pairing's code: the header shows it on every page, the reader says it digit by digit
tap SEQ
passkey 42613
wait 100
said PIN 0 4 2 6 1 3
shot bt_pin.png
passkey -1
wait 100
